# The total cost is paid whole or not at all (CR 601.2h), so the life it asks is counted together: Fire Covenant's "as an
# additional cost, pay X life" and Terror of the Peaks' additional 3 life for a spell an opponent casts at it (CR 118.8,
# 601.2f, 119.4). Bot2, at 9 life, announces X = 7 and divides the 7 damage onto Terror: 7 + 3 is more than 9, so the cast
# is taken back with nothing paid. Announced again with X = 4, all at Terror, it costs 4 + 3 = 7 life: Bot2 is at 2 and
# Terror (4 toughness) dies.

